**No, Taproot doesn't have a slider web component yet, so there's no tag name to use.** Slider exists in the spec as `component.slider` (status: stable), but that's only a technology-neutral contract. The spec reports no web implementation for it, and Slider isn't among the components listed as having one.

If you need a slider now, you could build one from the contract, which covers its anatomy, parameters, states, rules and tokens. I can pull those details and implement it for your project if you'd like. Any tag name would be your own rather than an official Taproot one.

